{"c":{"137629":["Dale",null,"b137629-w08BJx9LeYvT.png","At 18, he is a young but remarkable adventurer. While on a mission in the forest to defeat some beasts, he finds Latina and becomes her guardian. Usually he is very cool and capable but when it comes to Latina he turns into a soft mess of adoration.",115],"137630":["Latina",null,"b137630-xrUCqTCrlwr0.png","She is a girl of magical descent and Dale finds her abandoned in a forest. The details of her previous life are unknown. She is honest and kind and very smart. She soon becomes an idol for the adventurers who come to the inn. To hide her horns, she wears ribbons in her hair.",339],"138201":["Kenneth",null,"b138201-oTbNT8OAXNYs.png","",22],"138202":["Rita",null,"b138202-5mwX81cF2SnY.png","",30],"138203":["Chloe",null,"b138203-8AowDV0AguP7.png","",17],"138204":["Sylvia",null,"b138204-CainjIsbIj4l.png","",12],"138205":["Rudy","Male","b138205-AW4fDlHHJwvM.png","Has feelings for Latina.",13],"138206":["Marcel",null,"b138206-zFcpjMzQOgFS.png","",4],"138207":["Anthony",null,"b138207-gBdYPIAD7L3f.png","",3],"161479":["Maya",null,"b161479-ld4wsud1UmIZ.png","An adorable baby that gets attached to Latina a lot.",12],"180122":["Clarissa",null,"b180122-wMft3ClBxVbN.png","Mr. Cornelio's daughter.",1],"180123":["Douglas",null,"default.jpg","",0],"180124":["Duke Eldstedt",null,"b180124-POabHZPlIgh0.png","",0],"180125":["Frieda",null,"b180125-1Z8P6Izn81ab.png","Yorck's wife.",1],"180126":["Fal",null,"default.jpg","",0],"180127":["Glaros",null,"b180127-2dSSKQsHe7oG.png","",2],"180128":["Shihesu Gojo",null,"b180128-x3FDGmtm0xhw.png","Dale's grandfather's former party member.",1],"180129":["Hagel",null,"b180129-P1jp0pAfIIbb.jpg","",1],"180130":["Joseph",null,"b180130-ragzQwApGW8q.png","Dale's relative.",1],"180131":["Mr. Cornelio",null,"b180131-0fpegUL67AAC.png","",1],"180132":["Randolph",null,"b180132-HcydW8VtkVqy.png","Dale's father.",1],"180133":["Vinto",null,"b180133-DlNDStFcZNqN.jpg","",7],"180134":["Wendelgard",null,"b1801